{"accountName": "微步在线研究响应中心", "author": "微步在线研究响应中心", "body": null, "content": [{"text": "原创 微步情报局 2026-10-19 11:38 北京", "type": "p"}, {"text": "点击查看漏洞详情", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/T4OSm0sXdEPwaTicff99DGZOtYM7yxfzC1sIYcibAc5TtPTbtS0u71TR7EbOu1yHhicBYFUBGK9IOrkqcRQ9tj2Qbc3JicUYHXr04BpSia0fAfw8/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "漏洞概况", "type": "p"}, {"text": "近日，Microsoft Windows官方发布通告， 修复了Windo ws Shell 安全功能绕过漏洞（CVE-2026-9 6951）。微步情报局已复现该漏洞。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "经分析，Mark of the Web（M OTW）是 Windows 附加在外部来源文件上的安全标记。由于 .SettingContent-ms 文 件扩展名未被 Windows 识别为危险类型，用户打开带有该标记的此类文件时不会 弹出安 全警告； 钓鱼攻击者可通过邮件或即时消息投递特制文件并诱导 用户 打开，在无安全警告弹窗的 情况 下执行任意命令。", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/T4OSm0sXdEO3XUyA3KxpK07CIkMKRRZDodLfQfjpSKYia3qOZ88d7CibFjtlhfb7tZ3u8DzCN4EiaCsicd4tR9ich0fOdPibgw0XZKMJeU7VkpAGE/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "（完整漏洞情报请查阅 https://x.threatbook.com/v5/vul/XVE-2026-78023）", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞处置优先级(VPT)", "type": "p"}, {"text": "综合处置优先级： 高风险", "type": "p"}, {"_imgCount": true, "caption": "", "src": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/T4OSm0sXdEM4h9LLxX56YUnhbGDwdiaUSX2iclGuQcicI5SDdvePXcJTNvCudFjo7ubUFDmCVzJAKRCic6icFrdCgtTkH3L79XEt8dyLc1PPAZoc/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "type": "img"}, {"text": "基本信息", "type": "p"}, {"text": "微步编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "XVE-2026-78023", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVE编号", "type": "p"}, {"text": "CVE-2026-96951", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞类型", "type": "p"}, {"text": "安全功能绕过", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用条件评估", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用漏洞的网络条件", "type": "p"}, {"text": "远程", "type": "p"}, {"text": "是否需要绕过安全机制", "type": "p"}, {"text": "对被攻击系统的要求", "type": "p"}, {"text": "无特殊要求", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用漏洞的权限要求", "type": "p"}, {"text": "无须用户权限", "type": "p"}, {"text": "是否需要受害者配合", "type": "p"}, {"text": "利用情报", "type": "p"}, {"text": "是否有POC", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已知利用行为", "type": "p"}, {"text": "已有在野利用", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞影响范围", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 10 1809 < 10.0.17763.9376", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 10 21H2 < 10.0.19044.7807", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 10 22H2 < 10.0.19045.7807", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 11 23H2 < 10.0.22631.7652", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 11 24H2 < 10.0.26100.9711", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 11 25H2 < 10.0.26200.9711", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 11 26H1 < 10.0.28000.3231", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows 11 26H2 < 10.0.26300.9711", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows Server 2012 R2 < 6.3.9600.23470", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows Server 2016 < 10.0.14393.9612", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows Server 2019 < 10.0.17763.9376", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows Server 2022 < 10.0.20348.5761", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Windows Server 2025 < 10.0.26100.33650", "type": "p"}, {"text": "Outlook.com < 20260925.100", "type": "p"}, {"text": "漏洞复现", "type": "p"}, {"text": "1. 在受影响的Wi ndows环 境中，经邮箱/浏览器下载POC文件（ `poc_motw.SettingContent-ms`）后双击打开，无警告弹窗，直接启动计算器。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "2. 在修复版本打开POC文件，弹出安全警告。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "修复方案", "type": "p"}, {"text": "官方修复方案", "type": "h"}, {"text": "官方已发布修复方案，请访问链接下载： https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2026-96951", "type": "p"}, {"text": "临时缓解措施", "type": "h"}, {"text": "使用防护类设备，按扩展名拦截邮件、即时消息和网页下载附件及压缩包内的 .settingcontent-ms 与 .appcontent-ms。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "微步产品支撑", "type": "p"}, {"text": "微步漏洞情报于 20 26-10- 13 收录该漏洞。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "微步下一代威胁情报平台NGTIP及X情报中心已于漏洞收录时向漏洞订阅用户推送该漏洞情报，并将持续推送后续更新；对于已经录入资产的用户，支持实时自动化排查受影响资产。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "云沙箱S和微步沙箱分析平台OneSandbox的OneStatic引擎支持检测，规则 Exploit/CVE-2026-96951.a[WS] 已全网推送。", "type": "p"}, {"text": "OneSEC已支持检测, 关注告警规则ID:  2003", "type": "p"}, {"text": "跳转微信打开", "type": "p"}], "cover": "https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/T4OSm0sXdEPwaTicff99DGZOtYM7yxfzC1sIYcibAc5TtPTbtS0u71TR7EbOu1yHhicBYFUBGK9IOrkqcRQ9tj2Qbc3JicUYHXr04BpSia0fAfw8/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg", "date": "10月19日", "id": "2679994708", "summary": "原创 微步情报局 2026-10-19 11:38 北京 \n点击查看漏洞详情\n漏洞概况 \n近日，Microsoft Windows官方发布通告， 修复了Windo ws Shell 安全功能绕过漏洞（CVE-2026-9 6951）。微步情报局已复现该漏洞。 \n经分析，Mark of the Web（M OTW）是 Windows 附加在外部来源文件上的安全标记。由于 .SettingConten", "title": "打开即执行！Windows Shell 安全功能绕过漏洞已遭在野利用", "ts": 1792381080000, "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MTc3ODY4Mw==&mid=2247508993&idx=1&sn=1c0d83938d3bf46d778f4fcf0e098470"}